// CPU IMEM - full-model ANN scheduler with CPU post-processing (116 instructions)
// Matches Final/src/tb/model_tb.v ann_hw_build_sched_prog().
// Responsibilities:
//   - DMA GPU IMEM image into place
//   - DMA input activation image into GPU DMEM
//   - Iterate 36 schedule records under thread0-only control
//   - Poll DMA completion via CR9 and GPU completion via CR6
//   - DMA final logits back to CPU DMEM
//   - CPU post-process: transpose class-major logits to packet-major packed words in-place

